        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aaruuser'eé'. Barwaárí án ni kuungá' i gooiim ar tsár. Gawaá barwaduuká' tsaraawo aníng muruuwí nguna inslawtimís, as inslawoó hhohhó' nguwa daaraktis baraá munerhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma gár kuungá' tunduwa hariím a /aymi'iidaá aaruusér aáng ar hhohho' in insleerá', nee hara'ayaadá' Aako nee Ba/amusmo aa axweés ar loohír ya/abuuserhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár har geeraá ar xu'utír wa hariim a tí, deeloodár alhhe'eesaywo muu ni hardah oo ilatleerir'ín eeharahár. Inooín kuungá' nuri niqimisiyá', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tawa kaahi, «Inós al'axweesani ngina haniísiíke ar niwa ki/i, ala i amá? Baabi'iirén naa qaroó qatliyé', ala mura' sleémeero u ga/eerá'aáke i adoodaádí kaahh, adoodár aáng iimír yaamu kiwa tleéhh.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk adoorí káh, kaa gunqareés adór, iimír aáng doori nee yaamu kira tleéhh ar axweesantá Mungú. Kina tleéhh ar ma'aay, nee ar baraá ma'aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala yaamuudá' geera kina qwaareés sleeme ar ma'aay, ar ma'aydá' tluwoó da/atén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doori nee yaamu kuká' hamí dawá' kina amohhe'eés nee kin xún ar axweesantá Mungú sleeme, nee in kumiitiyá' ar adoorós tidá' i dirii'iya' ay bál deeloodár sakwasleema. Baldá' bira xeér, kiri daa/ ar asla, nee múk tlakuuse kuri sakwasleemuut nee kuri qwaarees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aaruuser'eé', gaarí wák ma gunqareesara'. Dír Aakoowo deelór wák a adór kureeraá kumuú wák, nee slám kureeraá kumuú wák a adór deelór wák dirose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu bahh'alé i kaahi, Aako al'axweesantós boo/eesaro i tligatliik. Ala a adoosingeeká. A inós kuungá' nun sageeqiqtlín. Asma tam heé wák iwa qwaari ga slaiiká. Ala masók sleémeero tlakweemaaín ngin hhu'u'uná'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala deelór Aako i hardát adór fisusmoó ar alé. Baldá' doori ni ilaá wa qwaariyá' ar kududuhoó úr, nee tsatse/ asla gu ót nee iri weeq. Yaamu nee muruú baraawós i dirií' sleémeero niri qwaariyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mura' sleémeero barqo in adoorír weeq, kuungá' gár tunduwa hariím masók an hotá' ar slafíngw hhohhó' nee oo Mungú kuwa ilaiwawa/a', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qoomár deeloodár Mungú kawa daamaraanda' nee kawa harakeemisa'. Ala deeloodá' bál binda hardát, doori asla gi ót nay weeqiyá', nee tam tsatse/ i weeq as asla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú al'axweesani ngina dirén i haniís, ar dooraá /aben kiwa slawaan, nee yaamaá /aben. Baraadaádae gár dáw a gan'amu. Nee atén muruuwí un haraxuaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe sla'aaruuser'eé', dír kuungá' tar muruuwí daamaraanda', ilakaaharu tleehhaak tawa wayduú koonda', nee tawa sihhita' dír geeraawós i alé tunduwa hhohhó' nee tawa múk xaslxaansli wásl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kuungá' xuaak adoorí Aako iwa qiqtlin a pa/ángw ba/ama ngu dirhúngií hanmiis. Tam hhiyaarén, kuduú sla'aarusmo, Paulo, adoorí sleeme ngaa gooín amorhúng i alé. Inós kuna geeraharahaár nee sagalooadá' aa dír Mungú wa sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' i kaahi baraá barwaduuwós kudá' sleémeerowo, qoomár bar i kaangwí alki/iit. Baraá barwaduuwose muruuko ku gawdén tsaahharo. Múk xu'utír koomaaká nee múk aa kwa/iiká muruuwí gun warqeemiis, adoodár muruú hatlá' sleeme oo baraá Gooi ngur warqeemaamisiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' sla'aaruuser'eé', kuungá' adoorí aga qaroó xué'. Gawaá adoorihe ti harmagahhe'. Ma ya/aamara' tunduwa uuruuxi baraá haratlintaaorhúng tidá' taa oti'i, nee tunduri qwaarees nee múk tlákw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kumiité' tawa urareera' Aakoorén nee Ba/amusmoorén Yesu Kristo kuwa xua', nee tawa gawduura' ar loohír tsuuqaawós kudá' ni tawó hanmamiisi dirhúng i alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós i xirfuuti iimír hamí ay alhhe'eesaay wasle. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
